  "feedback": [
    "Pawan Kalyan as Vakeel Saab remains recognizable through brow/eyes/nose, moustache and short beard, swept voluminous hair, black court coat and white advocate bands. The newly corrected crown is accepted from exact overhead/front-high/rear-high views and actual night/day scene.",
    "All15 fresh native views, fresh512portrait, three new crown views beside three labelled old comparisons, and all five actual Dil Raju film frames were personally opened through full-frame labelled sheets. Original rear hair/shoes and coarse stubble remain bounded stylization.",
    "Exact proposed GLB, private rig, semantically identical canonical rig, portrait and canonical three-file bundle were independently hash checked. Primary correct-film references and native scene evidence support the close-match verdict.",
    "Actual Q10 metro boarding, next different station, sequential four-person exit, supported stopped platform parking, manual carton catch, completion, Next and all-four retained relaxed idle passed independent native observation. Fixed night/day readability passed."
  ],
